9930 0 obj
  << /ActualText (They use a technique for harvesting cinnamon that we\047ve never\nencountered before \055 instead of chopping down the tree to\nharvest the bark\054 they make a deep cut around the base of the\ntree and let the bark dry on the tree for a couple of weeks before\nharvesting it\056 That makes it easier to harvest\054 but it also\nconcentrates essential oils rather than letting them evaporate as\nthe bark dries in the hot sun\056 The bark comes off the tree mostly\ndry and very intensely spicy and sweet\054 with a beautiful fragrance\nthat we could smell from half a mile away\056)
     /K [ 3304 ]
     /P 9931 0 R
     /Pg 3330 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

